  "practical_debug_checks": [
    "看 registration_summary.json 里的 delivered_mode、final_warp_score、affine_warp_score、n_inner_ctrl。",
    "看 subject_midline_profile.json 里的 reliability、valid_ratio、width_mean_px。",
    "看 final_warp_segmentation_overlay.png 是否出现脑区整体偏移、局部过弯或 midline 左右不对称。",
